BlueSky plugin bridging the BlueSky air traffic simulator to Frequentis's
telemetry-manager. Reports the live position/velocity of simulated
aircraft as PositionReports as if they were real tracked aircraft, and
consumes externally-sourced PositionReports back into the simulation as
injected or updated tracks.

Drop-in plugin: once installed, BlueSky automatically discovers it from
the shared plugin directory. Load it with "PLUGIN LOAD FRQ_TELEMETRY"
(or add FRQ_TELEMETRY to enabled_plugins in settings.cfg), then toggle
the bridge with the FRQTELEMETRY ON/OFF stack command.
